WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.101
The candidates stay still. The winner changes.

00:00:36.101 --> 00:01:13.108
Store the passages before the query arrives

00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:46.140
Cosine compares directional alignment

00:01:46.140 --> 00:02:17.294
Dot product also responds to length

00:02:17.294 --> 00:02:46.986
Unit length makes the rules agree

00:02:46.986 --> 00:03:18.244
More coordinates, the same operation

00:03:18.244 --> 00:03:53.767
A high score is not a relevance probability
